e, for that specific job posting.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Homepage shows \\\"Showing 8 jobs\\\" with a full list of 8 job cards (Senior Frontend Developer, Product Designer, Registered Nurse, Marketing Manager, Data Analyst, Part-Time Content Writer, DevOps Engineer, Elementary School Teacher).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Industry filter \\\"Technology\\\" narrowed 8→2 jobs; Location filter \\\"Remote\\\" narrowed to 2 remote jobs; Job Type filter \\\"Contract\\\" narrowed to 1 job (DevOps Engineer). Clear filters button resets to 8 jobs each time.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing \\\"Nurse\\\" into the search box instantly filtered results to \\\"Showing 1 jobs\\\" -> Registered Nurse.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Job details page includes an \\\"Apply for this position\\\" form with Full Name, Email, Phone (contact info) and Cover Letter/Message fields; submitting valid data produced a toast \\\"Application submitted! Your application for Senior Frontend Developer at TechCorp Solutions has been sent.\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting the form empty triggered HTML5 required-field validation (\\\"Please fill out this field.\\\") for Name, Email, Message, blocking submission. Entering an invalid email \\\"notanemail\\\" triggered \\\"Please include an '@' in the email address\\\" validation, also blocking submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking \\\"Post Job\\\" with all fields empty did not create a listing; browser-native required-field validation blocked submission with \\\"Please fill out this field.\\\" messages on Job Title, Min/Max Salary, and Job Description fields (all required), and dropdowns are required selects.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No duplicate-application prevention, and applications are not persisted at all\", \"actual\": \"Submitted two applications to job-1 with identical name/email (\\\"Test User\\\" / \\\"testuser@example.com\\\"); both were accepted with a success toast and no duplicate warning. Additionally, neither submission (nor a third with different info) was reflected in the employer dashboard's application list/count even after reload, so duplicate submissions are not blocked by contact information.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No authentication/authorization separating job seekers from employers\", \"actual\": \"There is no login, signup, or role-based access control anywhere in the app. The \\\"Post a Job\\\" link and /employer/post-job page are freely accessible to any visitor without any employer authentication, and the form was successfully submitted (job \\\"QA Automation Engineer\\\" was published) with no identity check. Any job seeker visiting the site can post a job opening in the exact same way an employer would.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Application submissions are not persisted to the backend\", \"actual\": \"Submitting the application form always shows a success toast (\\\"Application submitted!\\\"), but after submitting 3 additional applications to job-1 (including a uniquely-named \\\"QA Tester\\\" applicant), the Employer Dashboard's application count for that job and the Total Applications stat remained unchanged (2 and 3 respectively) even after a full page reload. The new applications never appear in the dashboard's applications list, indicating the system does not actually receive/store the submitted applications despite the success confirmation.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each filter/search change (Industry, Location, Job Type, keyword) updated the \\\"Showing N jobs\\\" count and list immediately without page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each job card displays title (e.g. \\\"Senior Frontend Developer\\\"), location (e.g. \\\"San Francisco, CA\\\"), and salary range (e.g. \\\"$140k - $180k\\\"), plus company, date, tags, industry and employment type.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Job details page for job-1 shows title, company, location, salary, posted date, full Job Description with Responsibilities and Requirements lists, and a Required Skills section (React, TypeScript, CSS, Node.js).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"The expanded Applications panel for Senior Frontend Developer clearly lists two distinct applicants (Alex Johnson - alex.j@email.com/555-0101/Jan 20, Maria Garcia - maria.g@email.com/555-0102/Jan 22) each with their own name, contact info, date, and cover-letter message.\"}]}"
